  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The information submitted does not accurately match with the existing site circumstances with particular reference to the internal layout and external alterations, fenestration details and lack of existing elevations. Furthermore insufficient evidence has been submitted to the Local Planning Authority to demonstrate that, on the balance of probabilities, the property has been in use as a self contained two bedroom residential flat with external changes, for a continuous period of four years prior to 25/04/2024.&amp;nbsp; As such, the application would not meet the requirements of S191(5) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;"
